  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 220.06 Written Comments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 220.06 Written Comments. Individuals may submit written comments to the commissioner or designee on proposed rulemaking actions any time from the time notice has been published until the end of the written comment period as set forth in the notice of rulemaking.\n\nSource. #8230-A, eff 12-17-04 (formerly Saf-C 218.06, renumbered by #8544); (formerly Saf-C 219.06, renumbered by #9724)",
